      "code": "def build_agent(sandbox):\n    # Place the beam in the keep-out zone but close to the core to intercept boulders\n    # Beam centered at (12.2, 1.5) with width 1.0m, height 0.3m\n    beam_x = 13.5 - 1.3  # Ensure distance from core center is >= 1.3m\n    beam_y = 1.5\n    beam = sandbox.add_beam(x=beam_x, y=beam_y, width=1.0, height=0.3, density=1.0)\n    \n    # Connect the beam to the ground with multiple joints to distribute forces\n    # Joints spaced along the beam's width (x-direction) at y=0.0\n    for x_offset in [-0.5, -0.3, -0.1, 0.1, 0.3, 0.5]:\n        joint_x = beam_x + x_offset\n        sandbox.add_joint(beam, None, (joint_x, 0.0), type='rigid')\n    \n    return beam\n\ndef agent_action(sandbox, agent_body, step_count):\n    pass",
